WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:01.754
Roxy looked around.

2
00:00:01.755 --> 00:00:03.651
The memories were over.

3
00:00:03.652 --> 00:00:05.652
She was back in the old factory.

4
00:00:05.653 --> 00:00:07.417
It was late at night.

5
00:00:07.418 --> 00:00:10.256
Brain Invader floated in front of her.

6
00:00:10.257 --> 00:00:11.526
He made a fist.

7
00:00:11.527 --> 00:00:14.546
"Why are you so hard to control, Rocket Girl?"

8
00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:17.344
Roxy tried to fire her eye laser beams.

9
00:00:17.345 --> 00:00:20.181
"Stop!" Brain Invader said in her head.

10
00:00:20.182 --> 00:00:23.483
"Okay, I will," Roxy thought.

11
00:00:23.484 --> 00:00:27.577
Then she got mad. "Hey! Stop controlling me!"

12
00:00:27.578 --> 00:00:30.240
She tried again to fire her eye laser beams.

13
00:00:30.241 --> 00:00:33.277
"Don't do it!" Brain Invader said.

14
00:00:33.278 --> 00:00:35.387
Roxy tried to ignore his voice.

15
00:00:35.388 --> 00:00:39.836
"Don't . . . tell me . . . what . . . to do!"

16
00:00:39.837 --> 00:00:43.931
Whiz-hoo! She forced her eye laser beams to fire.

17
00:00:43.932 --> 00:00:45.765
The villain held up a hand.

18
00:00:45.766 --> 00:00:48.336
The laser beams turned before they reached him.

19
00:00:48.337 --> 00:00:52.172
They hit a support beam. Boom!

20
00:00:52.173 --> 00:00:54.501
The building began to crumble.

21
00:00:54.502 --> 00:00:56.349
Brain Invader vanished.

22
00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:07.831
Roxy escaped as rubble fell to the ground.

23
00:01:07.832 --> 00:01:10.664
*** The next morning Roxy woke up

24
00:01:10.665 --> 00:01:15.425
early. "I have to tell Dr. Chen about Brain

25
00:01:15.426 --> 00:01:23.219
Invader." She flew to the

26
00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:26.065
lab. Private Benson was reading a book in her

27
00:01:26.066 --> 00:01:28.730
cell. Dr. Chen wiped slime off the

28
00:01:28.731 --> 00:01:30.870
wall. The Mighty Man actor

29
00:01:30.871 --> 00:01:33.186
smiled. "Good news, Rocket

30
00:01:33.187 --> 00:01:35.140
Girl!" Slime shot from his

31
00:01:35.141 --> 00:01:36.611
hand. It sprayed a chair.

32
00:01:36.612 --> 00:01:39.964
"Dr. Chen's cure is almost ready!"

33
00:01:39.965 --> 00:01:41.770
Dr. Chen walked over.

34
00:01:41.771 --> 00:01:45.473
"I just need to check a couple of things."

35
00:01:45.474 --> 00:01:47.923
She saw the slimy chair and frowned.

36
00:01:47.924 --> 00:01:51.041
"Then the cure will be ready."

37
00:01:51.042 --> 00:01:53.407
"Great!" Roxy said.

38
00:01:53.408 --> 00:01:55.702
"But we have another problem.

39
00:01:55.703 --> 00:02:00.132
I found out who's controlling me and Private Benson.

40
00:02:00.133 --> 00:02:02.967
He calls himself Brain Invader.

41
00:02:02.968 --> 00:02:05.311
He wants to take over the world."

42
00:02:05.312 --> 00:02:10.064
Private Benson gasped. "That's terrible!"

43
00:02:10.065 --> 00:02:13.718
"Do you still need to be in that cell?" Roxy asked.

44
00:02:13.719 --> 00:02:15.528
"You seem fine."

45
00:02:15.529 --> 00:02:18.558
"I'm staying in here," Private Benson said.

46
00:02:18.559 --> 00:02:24.291
"I don't hear Brain Invader's voice at all. My mind is calm."

47
00:02:24.292 --> 00:02:28.732
"Brain Invader sounds very dangerous," Dr. Chen said.

48
00:02:28.733 --> 00:02:31.365
"I must finish the cure quickly."

49
00:02:31.366 --> 00:02:34.346
Suddenly Roxy heard Brain Invader's voice.

50
00:02:34.347 --> 00:02:36.790
"Join me, Rocket Girl."

51
00:02:36.791 --> 00:02:38.368
Roxy spun around.

52
00:02:38.369 --> 00:02:40.106
The voice was in her head.

53
00:02:40.107 --> 00:02:43.741
"Get out of my head, Brain Invader," Roxy thought.

54
00:02:43.742 --> 00:02:47.859
"We can rule the world," the villain said.

55
00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:49.886
The Mighty Man actor stood up.

56
00:02:49.887 --> 00:02:51.527
He looked at Roxy.

57
00:02:51.528 --> 00:02:53.675
Roxy didn't see him though.

58
00:02:53.676 --> 00:02:58.310
She was thinking hard. "Get out of my head!"

59
00:02:58.311 --> 00:03:01.434
"So, you won't join me?" Brain Invader asked.

60
00:03:01.435 --> 00:03:03.581
"No!" Roxy thought.

61
00:03:03.582 --> 00:03:06.834
"Then good-bye, Rocket Girl!" Brain Invader said.

62
00:03:06.835 --> 00:03:10.818
The Mighty Man actor walked toward Roxy.

63
00:03:10.819 --> 00:03:15.647
"Destroy Rocket Girl!"

